# GitNexus Rules

- Use GitNexus for large repos, unclear dependency chains, or broad changes.
- Prefer graph context before editing when call chains, clusters, or blast radius matter.
- Reindex after structural commits or dependency changes when the graph may be stale.
- Use GitNexus output to identify related files, execution flows, and likely tests.
